<ArticleLayout title="Privacy policy" description="What Child Savings Lab does and does not collect, including the local-only handling of calculator inputs." effective="MVP privacy practices as of October 8, 2026">
  <h2>Calculator data</h2>
  <p>Eligibility and growth calculator inputs are processed in your browser. They are not transmitted to or stored by Child Savings Lab. We do not request real Social Security numbers, names, tax IDs, account numbers, child names, or home addresses.</p>
  <h2>Analytics</h2>
  <p>This MVP does not include third-party analytics, advertising pixels, session replay, or behavioral profiling. If privacy-friendly analytics are added, calculator field values will be excluded from collection.</p>
  <h2>Email</h2>
  <p>No newsletter form is active in this MVP. A future update service, if introduced, will collect only the minimum information required—typically an email address—and will not request child, tax, or account information.</p>
  <h2>Hosting logs and links</h2>
  <p>The hosting provider may process ordinary security and request logs. Links to official or third-party sites are governed by those sites’ privacy practices.</p>
  <h2>Questions</h2>
  <p>Use the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a> for privacy questions. This policy should receive legal review before a public production launch.</p>
</ArticleLayout>
